From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gyuyoung Kim <qkim@google.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 03:19:54 +0000
Subject: [M150-LTS][a11y-image-desc] Guard AXImageAnnotator::OnImageAnnotated
 re-entrancy

Updating layout and AX across all documents inside OnImageAnnotated()
can synchronously run script or frame observers and detach the frame or
deactivate the document, destroying `this`. Require a non-null active AX
context before and after UpdateAXForAllDocuments(), and guard `this`
with a WeakPtr across the update.

AX-Relnotes: n/a.
Bug: 580869107
Change-Id: Ib1f6f51d26a29d9b22949816684e4a736e513950
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8721771
Reviewed-by: David Tseng <dtseng@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Ramin Halavati <rhalavati@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1737305}
(cherry picked from commit 87638e8e5c988a5e26d4905b69eced454e64b86a)

